OL,3,ATrump says Canada wants 'benefits' of
OL,4,Abeing US state as Carney says countries
OL,5,Ain trade war
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump says Canada
OL,8,Fwants "the benefits of a State, without
OL,9,Fbeing one" after trade talks between
OL,10,Fthe two countries collapsed late on
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,13,FIn his first comments after
OL,14,Fnegotiations broke down, triggering new
OL,15,F50% US tariffs on a range of Canadian
OL,16,Fgoods, Trump also said US farmers had
OL,17,Fbeen charged "massive amounts of
OL,18,FTariffs" for years.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
