OL,3,ATrump says Canada wants 'benefits' of
OL,4,Abeing US state as Carney says countries
OL,5,Ain trade war
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after Canadian Prime Minister
OL,8,FMark Carney called the fresh US tariffs
OL,9,Fon Canada a "miscalculation" designed
OL,10,Fto "hurt and divide us".
OL,12,FCarney confirmed he would match Trump's
OL,13,Ftariffs "dollar-for-dollar" from 8
OL,14,FSeptember, including levies on steel,
OL,15,Fdairy, appliances and electronics. The
OL,16,FUS and Canada were now in a trade
OL,17,F"war", he said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
